    "text": "By Brooke Sjoberg ,\n8 hours ago The company will consolidate its real estate footprint in the Austin area, and listed its Round Rock facility at 1100 W. Louis Henna Blvd. for sale in March. (Brooke Sjoberg/Community Impact) Emerson will relocate operations from its Round Rock facility to Austin over the next year or so, representatives confirmed... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
